  "thag1.86:0.4": "1. 9. 6. sunāgattheragāthā. ",
  "thag1.86:1.1": "ito bahiddhā puthu aññavādinaṃ ",
  "thag1.86:1.2": "maggo na nibbānagamo yathā ayaṃ, ",
  "thag1.86:1.3": "itissu saṅghaṃ bhagavānusāsati ",
  "thag1.86:1.4": "satthā sayaṃ pāṇitaleva dassaya’nti. itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ",
  "thag1.86:1.5": "nāgito thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. "
}
